# Declared factual interface
```catala
declaration scope Bands:
  input amount content decimal
  input threshold content decimal
  input lowerRate content decimal
  input upperRate content decimal
  output charge content money
```

```catala
scope Bands:
  definition charge equals
    money of (100.0 * (if amount <= threshold
      then amount * lowerRate
      else threshold * lowerRate + (amount - threshold) * upperRate))
```
